{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c597e9d4470124ef97aaf6643015104dbb91ee230e88cf3363c9d4c2188c0a7c",
      "text": "“只要动用我的力量，这种事轻而易举！\n啊哈哈哈哈！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52025d2962749027d5ca9fad71703c0c778b9dc00d5a784bffeb88b9050ff4f4",
      "text": "……黑酱也是这么说的，\n应该是他做出了努力吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43dc2291903acec7b6b6305f52bd9082c07a9190a4d4616541f1767b202f75b9",
      "text": "也是啊……虽然一开始觉得他是个可疑的大叔，\n但该办的事确实都给办好了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bd0529c76f392d5eea2d85d1b6e4fc6882df8f822f7c0f0068b68b2bbc1e207",
      "text": "真不愧是961 Pro的社长。得好好谢谢他才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ff470c84830748e8baadae0aaed019590fc7c8f0c8c6ea89a375fe1da973c9e",
      "text": "（说起来，之前正准备进休息室的时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac039f32d92ff456562ddd41e145e459779b1e142fe24c99bf551623792a9722",
      "text": "……承蒙关照了。\n关于那个……的事情……是的，没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b327e0caac3179a2561b7493e8c67d42435bab2b8ea6fad4da223f580a426021",
      "text": "是的呢……把那个偶像给……\n替换成……我们家的Jupiter，务必……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29b809bd2f72c4da9b26a4874926cc88a8713c5782ffa600ad4943a203dbeaab",
      "text": "（那个时候的电话，和这次的节目出演。\n是不是有什么联系，呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7907de90aeea32aad81b3265bace26f51adc8aeec309dab3013ac6bc9fdf54bf",
      "text": "……也是呢。\n今天就去俘获各位天使酱的心吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04ab3663ce0b3a52473c152b64dca27354d2744657b15d8a7e2cbdcd95d05e66",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n嘛，既然要做，我也绝对会拼尽全力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d701cd97bde7dcdf056916fd3952092ac73d07f68b0db864c1266bdf034fc30",
      "text": "冬马君，太热血过头啦～\n不过，我也没打算偷懒就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea0fe9da8962b1a3c7c9ea4fa1e5f6334cfb5a73e382b6fc75d822784cdb3d7",
      "text": "所以说……\n除了大获成功以外，别无可能对吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
